  "prefLabel": "Ed 902.07 Return to school rate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 902.07 “Return to school rate” means “return to school rate” as defined in RSA 189:59,I,(k), namely, the percentage of students in grades 9-11 enrolled in the program who return to the school for the next school year.\n\nSource. #8582, eff 3-15-06; ss by #10649, eff 7-26-14",
